       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "After a long wait and tons of request, we are back with a new, exciting update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to your continued love and support, we have added Vietnamese subtitles to FHUOR2 🌸",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update is also available on FHUOR2 Mobile.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We truly appreciate the patience of Viet fans who have waited for this update, and we hope you enjoy the game even more!",
